{"seq":7,"slug":"computer-networking","title":"计算机网络","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"计算机网络-简介\">计算机网络 简介</h1><p>计算机网络是连接数字世界的基础设施。从你打开浏览器加载网页的那一刻起，数据便在网络协议的驱动下穿越无数节点，最终呈现在你的屏幕上。理解计算机网络的工作原理，不仅能帮助开发者编写更高效的网络应用，还能在排查网络故障、优化系统性能和设计分布式架构时提供坚实的理论支撑。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望系统性学习计算机网络知识的软件工程师和计算机科学学习者。无论你是前端开发者想要理解 HTTP 协议的细节，后端工程师需要设计高可用的网络服务，还是对网络安全感兴趣的技术爱好者，这里都将为你提供清晰的知识脉络。</p>\n<p>知识库将按照自底向上的方式组织内容：网络体系结构与分层模型，理解 OSI 和 TCP/IP 模型的设计哲学；物理层与数据链路层基础，了解数据传输的底层机制；网络层与路由协议，掌握 IP 地址、子网划分和路由算法；传输层核心协议，深入 TCP 与 UDP 的工作机制；应用层协议详解，涵盖 HTTP、DNS、WebSocket 等开发者最常接触的协议；以及网络安全基础，探讨加密、认证和常见攻击防御策略。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-fundamentals","title":"网络基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"osi-and-tcpip","title":"OSI 与 TCP/IP 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-fundamentals/osi-and-tcpip"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ip-addressing","title":"IP 寻址","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-fundamentals/ip-addressing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"routing-protocols","title":"路由协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-fundamentals/routing-protocols"},{"seq":4,"slug":"switching-and-vlans","title":"交换与 VLAN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-fundamentals/switching-and-vlans"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"transport-layer","title":"传输层","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tcp-deep-dive","title":"TCP 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer/tcp-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"udp-and-realtime","title":"UDP 与实时通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer/udp-and-realtime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"socket-programming","title":"Socket 编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer/socket-programming"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quic-protocol","title":"QUIC 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer/quic-protocol"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"application-layer","title":"应用层协议","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"http-protocol","title":"HTTP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/http-protocol"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dns-system","title":"DNS 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/dns-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"websocket-and-grpc","title":"WebSocket 与 gRPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/websocket-and-grpc"},{"seq":4,"slug":"email-and-ftp","title":"邮件与 FTP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/email-and-ftp"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-security","title":"网络安全","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tls-and-https","title":"TLS 与 HTTPS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-security/tls-and-https"},{"seq":2,"slug":"firewall-and-ids","title":"防火墙与 IDS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-security/firewall-and-ids"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vpn-and-tunneling","title":"VPN 与隧道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-security/vpn-and-tunneling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"attack-defense","title":"攻击与防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/network-security/attack-defense"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"modern-networking","title":"现代网络架构","docCount":4,"url":"